# No Cursor commit attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailer.
- Never add `Made-with: Cursor`.
- Never pass `--trailer` for Cursor attribution on `git commit` / `git commit --amend`.
- Commit subject/body only — no agent co-author lines.
- Keep Attribution OFF: Cursor Settings → Git & Pull Requests → Attribution (Commit + PR).
- CLI: `~/.cursor/cli-config.json` → `attribution.attributeCommitsToAgent` and `attributePRsToAgent` must stay `false`.
